+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/people/{personId}/plans — add a plan to a person: an amount the claim form takes for a
+# claim that corrects nothing, a start and an end date (yyyy-MM-dd, the end not before the start) and every N days (a
+# whole number, at least 1). Any other is a 400, a person not on the sheet a 404, none writing anything. Writes
+# PLAN_ADDED. Responds 201 with the plan.
+validate:
